ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models
Project Planning
1. Project Planning Overview
ComicCraft is an AI-powered comic story creation system that uses Gemini models to help users transform a simple idea into a complete comic. The project will be developed in phases, beginning with requirement gathering and system design and progressing through implementation, AI integration, testing, deployment, and maintenance.
The primary development flow is:
Planning → Design → Development → AI Integration → Testing → Deployment → Maintenance
________________________________________
2. Project Objectives
The project aims to:
•	Develop an easy-to-use AI comic creation platform.
•	Generate stories from user-provided ideas.
•	Generate characters, scenes, dialogue, and narration using Gemini.
•	Organize generated content into comic panels.
•	Allow users to edit AI-generated content.
•	Provide comic preview functionality.
•	Export completed comics as PDF/images.
•	Maintain user projects for future editing.
