23. Risk Management
Risk	Impact	Mitigation
Gemini API failure	High	Retry mechanism and fallback messages
High AI usage/cost	High	Rate limits and usage controls
Inconsistent AI output	High	Structured prompts and schema validation
Image generation failure	Medium	Allow image upload/manual replacement
Database failure	High	Backups
API key exposure	Critical	Store secrets server-side
Poor AI-generated story	Medium	Allow regeneration/editing
Large project size	Medium	Pagination and optimized storage
Schedule delays	High	Prioritize MVP features
