Expected Final Outcome
At the end of the project, a user should be able to enter a simple comic idea, have Gemini transform it into a structured story with characters, scenes, panels, dialogue and narration, edit the generated comic, preview it, and export the finished work. This provides a clear, demonstrable end-to-end workflow for the ComicCraft project.

